; NexusBackup edge proxy: 7445/tcp is the appliance control port (docs/edge.md).
; portcon is not allowed in a refpolicy (.te) module; CIL modules may carry it.
; Needs nexus_edge.pp (defines nexus_edge_control_port_t) loaded first.
(portcon tcp 7445 (system_u object_r nexus_edge_control_port_t ((s0) (s0))))
